WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.293
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:08.170
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> My husband Eddie and I always go out for a drink or for dinner.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:10.777
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.923 --> 00:00:14.380
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We sometimes meet friends there, too.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:17.047
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.274 --> 00:00:22.680
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> In the evening we usually stay at home and watch TV.